 "titulo": "Then we will fight in the shade ⚔️ Thermopylae Part 2 #story #shorts",
 "capa": "FIGHT IN THE SHADE",
 "descripcion": "Persian arrows would block out the sun, they warned. A Spartan named Dienekes had an answer. For two days the wall of shields held, and Xerxes leapt from his throne three times.\n\n> Part 3: {when_next}.\nWould you have stood in the front row?\n\nFrom Herodotus, Histories, book 7 (chapters 175-228). Herodotus gives millions of Persians; modern historians estimate roughly 100,000 to 300,000.\n#thermopylae #sparta #300 #ancienthistory #shorts",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "On the fifth day, Xerxes stopped waiting, and *attacked*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "A local man warned the Greeks what was coming.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The Persians have so many archers, their arrows will hide the sun.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "A Spartan named Dienekes only shrugged.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Good. Then we will fight *in the shade*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Herodotus wrote that line down, and it's been quoted for 2,500 years.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because the first wave hit the pass like a flood.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The Spartans locked their shields into a wall of bronze.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Long spears over the top. Strike, push, step back, strike again.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Wave after wave broke against it, and the bodies piled up.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then Xerxes sent his best: *the Immortals*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Ten thousand elite soldiers. When one fell, another took his place.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The Spartans faked a retreat, turned around, and cut them down.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Herodotus says Xerxes, watching from his throne, *leapt up three times* in fear for his army.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Two days. The pass held.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "But that night, a Greek walked into the Persian camp.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "His name was *Ephialtes*, and he wanted gold.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "He knew a path over the mountain. Part three, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
